foundation.question_text:
This scale drawing of a garden uses a scale of $1:200$. Find the real length of the garden, in metres.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4,2.4);
\node[below] at (2,0) {$6\text{ cm}$};
\node at (2,1.2) {Garden};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

development.question_text:
This scale drawing of a swimming pool uses a scale of $1:400$. Find the real length and real width of the pool, in metres.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (4,2.4);
\node[below] at (2,0) {$5\text{ cm}$};
\node[left] at (0,1.2) {$3\text{ cm}$};
\node at (2,1.2) {Pool};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

mastery.question_text:
On this scale drawing of a building, the $4$ cm wall represents a real length of $8$ m. Find the real length of the $6$ cm wall, in metres.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (3.6,2.4);
\node[below] at (1.8,0) {$6\text{ cm}$};
\node[left] at (0,1.2) {$4\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
